  "description": "Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B (revision 2fc06364) model definition without a runtime: the pinned chat template rendered in C# for text and tool-calling conversations (system, user, assistant and tool messages, tool definitions and calls, thinking switch; images rejected), a parser for the template's tool-call format (whole or streamed), the llguidance tool-call grammar builder, per-request chat options, the checkpoint's ModelProfile (repository, revision, owned tokenizer profile qwen35-bpe-chat, template digest, end-of-sequence ids, decoder shape) and the asset lock of the Hub checkpoint itself (safetensors, config, tokenizer, template). No ONNX Runtime dependency. To run the model in-process on ONNX Runtime GenAI, reference Starlings.Models.Qwen35.OnnxGenAI. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
